{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y 在 S11、S12 等短停留段仍有感受提示过密的问题，容易让观众来不及消化；X 的双栏压缩更适合快速扫读。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y 用【】把每段最重要的心理转折突出出来，观众更容易抓住人物此刻的念头；叙述也更充分地解释了他为什么既怀念过去的亲近，又不愿重新忍受委屈，前后心理变化有清楚的因果联系。「当作自己人」等线索反复回扣，加上与音乐具体时刻对应的音色、节奏、身体感受和情绪变化，使整首曲子的情感过程更连贯、更细腻；X 虽然更容易快速扫读，但不少音乐感受被压缩成了概括性词组，失去了部分层次。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "de0b9190-ef63-4df9-9c6d-f47b78308dae", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T154808268248Z", "elapsed_seconds": 111.453, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T15:49:59.728407+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "123687265a825c9df9eef02f6fd8e82b28454364e6bff5d2563acdcd394a5611", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chat